  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I've sent your case to a specialist. Your reference number is **ESC-700**, and they'll contact you within 24 hours.\n\nI told them you feel the delivery was over an hour late and that you'd like bigger compensation, preferably on your card. I also included the delivery times from our records and the $3.99 credit I've already added. I can't promise what they'll decide, but they'll review everything.\n\nThe $3.99 credit stays on your account either way, and it will be applied to your next order. Is there anything else I can help with?"
